 "description": "Search WITHIN a documentation set for a specific entry (method/function/API/property) by substring \u2014 THIS is the content lookup. E.g. slug=\"javascript\", query=\"Array.map\"; slug=\"python\", query=\"os.path\". Get valid slugs from docs/search_docs.",
